{"summary":"The AI Tutor for MBA Students is a hypothetical pilot in EdTech, targeting US MBA students. It aims to provide timely, personalized business-case reasoning feedback, addressing a demand hypothesis. The solution is an English-language AI case-coaching service. The project is at concept stage with no verified users, revenue, or partnerships.","market":[{"topic":"Graduate Degree Market Size","text":"The US graduate degree market is substantial, with 880,200 master's degrees conferred in 2021-22 [E03].","why":"This establishes the overall market size for graduate education, which includes MBA students.","c":"high","cr":"directly_supported","claims":[{"i":"MKT01","t":"Master's degrees conferred in the US increased by 16% from 2011-12 to 2021-22, reaching 880,200 [E03].","k":"factual","d":"The total number of master's degrees conferred in the US shows a significant market for graduate education.","s":"sourced_fact","e":["E03"],"f":[],"ss":"direct","q":0.9,"c":"high","cr":"directly_supported"},{"i":"MKT02","t":"Business degrees accounted for 23% of master's degrees in 2021-22, totaling 205,800 degrees [E04].","k":"factual","d":"This indicates a large segment of the master's degree market is directly relevant to the MBA target audience.","s":"sourced_fact","e":["E04"],"f":[],"ss":"direct","q":0.9,"c":"high","cr":"directly_supported"}]},{"topic":"FERPA Compliance","text":"FERPA rights transfer to students upon entering postsecondary institutions, impacting data handling [E05].","why":"Understanding FERPA is crucial for any educational service dealing with student data.","c":"high","cr":"directly_supported","claims":[{"i":"MKT03","t":"FERPA rights transfer to students when they enter a postsecondary institution at any age [E05].","k":"factual","d":"This federal law governs student education records and data privacy, which is critical for an EdTech service.","s":"sourced_fact","e":["E05"],"f":[],"ss":"direct","q":0.9,"c":"high","cr":"directly_supported"}]}]
,"customer":[{"topic":"Target Customer Problem","text":"The pilot tests if MBA students need more timely, personalized business-case reasoning feedback.","why":"This directly addresses the core problem the AI Tutor aims to solve for its target demographic.","c":"high","cr":"assumption_dominant","claims":[{"i":"CUS01","t":"The proposed pilot tests whether students need more timely, personalized business-case reasoning feedback.","k":"assumption","d":"The core problem statement for the AI Tutor is a demand hypothesis, not a verified market fact.","s":"assumption","e":[],"f":[],"ss":"none","q":0.5,"p":"This is a demand hypothesis, not a verified market fact.","c":"medium","cr":"assumption_dominant"},{"i":"CUS02","t":"US adults enrolled in or applying to MBA/business graduate programs are the target customers.","k":"factual","d":"This defines the primary demographic for the AI Tutor service.","s":"unsupported","e":[],"f":[],"ss":"none","q":0.7,"c":"high","cr":"no_evidence"}]},{"topic":"Institutional Buyers","text":"Business-school instructors are potential institutional buyers for the AI Tutor service.","why":"Identifying institutional buyers expands the potential market beyond individual students.","c":"medium","cr":"unsupported","claims":[{"i":"CUS03","t":"Business-school instructors are potential institutional buyers.","k":"factual","d":"This identifies a secondary target audience for the AI Tutor, suggesting a B2B sales channel.","s":"unsupported","e":[],"f":[],"ss":"none","q":0.6,"c":"medium","cr":"no_evidence"}]}]
,"competition":[{"topic":"Existing AI Tutoring Benchmarks","text":"Khanmigo offers personalized tutoring and coaching, serving as an adjacent benchmark [E01].","why":"Khanmigo is a known AI tutoring service, providing a reference point for AI-driven educational tools.","c":"high","cr":"directly_supported","claims":[{"i":"COM01","t":"Khanmigo provides personalized tutoring and coaching for skills mastery and career advancement [E01].","k":"factual","d":"Khanmigo demonstrates an existing model for AI-powered educational support, though not specifically for MBA cases.","s":"sourced_fact","e":["E01"],"f":[],"ss":"direct","q":0.8,"c":"high","cr":"directly_supported"},{"i":"COM02","t":"Khanmigo offers district tools including access for teachers and students, and data for instructional decisions [E02].","k":"factual","d":"This shows a competitor's capability to integrate with educational institutions and provide data insights.","s":"sourced_fact","e":["E02"],"f":[],"ss":"direct","q":0.8,"c":"high","cr":"directly_supported"}]}]}

